<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Coal - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Coal - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.54		vs	   52.27</p>
<p> Operating	  217    million    vs	  564    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 24    million    vs	prft 453 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 62    million    vs	prft 143 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 0.81 yen	  vs     prft 1.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     77 million	  vs	  77 million</p>
<p> Interim div	    --		vs		--</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumitomo Coal Mining Co Ltd is a coal distributor.</p>
</text>
